Golden vectors (ADR-004 — KMP+C# cannot drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FeedbackGoldenTest inlines language-neutral fixtures (fixed inputs in / fixed
expectations out) for the two non-trivial derivations:
  feedbackQuery   : empty, status_only, category_only, all_params,
                    blank_filters_dropped, zero_paging_sent
  feedbackCacheKey: empty, status_only, full, empty_status_stays_empty, zero_paging
The C# port mirrors these exact rows.

